    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111675" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιτρός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>block of wood, log,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιτρῶν καὶ λάων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.29
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				21.314
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιτροὺς αἶψα ταμόντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.405
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				246
			</span></i> ( =
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				11.1218a2
			</span></i>); <i>bole</i> or <i>trunk</i> of a tree, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				12.137
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>firebrand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
				5.142
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				913
			</span></i>.</div>
